# The per-centre icons the app wears at runtime. The .ico half slipped through
# (it is not a .png) while the .png half was swallowed by the rule above — so
# CI, which builds from this repo, shipped a macOS app whose Dock icon could
# never change, and any clean checkout would have done the same on Windows.
!build/centre-icons/
!build/centre-icons/*.png

# App Store Connect .p8 written by the macOS release workflows — never commit one.
private_keys/
